0/4BzzHxLrrkLTljwB4ujgFFYbPN2.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0JvZGtpbiUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.4","title":"Poison or Something","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-05-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The crew's investigation takes a bizarre turn, jeopardizing their podcast. Gilbert attempts to settle a debt, while Dove gives Emmy harsh advice.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xNkDzgpZ5rUO7IYVVzaNZkpLreQ.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0JvZGtpbiUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.5","title":"Peace in Our Time","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-05-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Gilbert learns about Bodkin's shady dealings. Dove stirs up trouble at the pub. With new evidence, the crew pieces together a shocking narrative.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6NYXbhWbZSwKGEXIdff9XJG0sIu.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0JvZGtpbiUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.6","title":"Ends Justify Means","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-05-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Back at Inish Mac Tire, Dove and Emmy seek answers but get sidetracked by troubling visions — and revelations. Gilbert deals with a daunting dilemma.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/atIefJZSmXk6jWhrNoNk4EjDbIr.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0JvZGtpbiUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.7","title":"Empty Your Pockets","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2024-05-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The Samhain festival opens old wounds amid hidden threats. As their pursuit of the truth comes to an end, Dove, Gilbert and Emmy embrace new beginnings.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/28rFLEygKX9WgmYS4pKpECoEG0y.jpg"}]}}